{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0033_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "0ff99dcb0daefd9e3c990170a60dbd9845f980f3b26a09e671664e4bd7ff5189", "ja": "{$P$}さん、しってた？\nあのね、流れ星って……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你知道吗？\n那个啊，关于流星……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0033_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "bb339524e09384cc02688b9661c4d151e905b2eabd450145e5fc60288dcffff6", "ja": "見つけてから消えるまでのあいだに3回お願いすると、\nお願いをかなえてくれるんだって！", "zh": "听说看到流星的时候，只要在它消失前许三次愿，\n就能实现愿望喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0033_1002_p", "source_sha256": "15c460ddeea32f8350eace554960cb4ed95fe7328de62a4514391e9e28a993c7", "ja": "ああ、まあ、有名な話だからな。", "zh": "我知道，毕竟是很有名的传说啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0033_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "f0f45142a45619f21c0852867b3af139f41415bb26180d85e1a27f162e41f9d5", "ja": "しってたんだ？　それじゃ、みんなで星を見た夜も、\n{$P$}さんは何かお願いしたの？", "zh": "你知道啊？那么在大家一起看星星的那晚，\n{$P$}先生也有许什么愿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0033_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9d9f43c753977515853a68483a9081d9159b51437dc55ef9ab0e882308ff7156", "ja": "もちろん。育たちの新曲の仕事が\n成功しますようにって。", "zh": "那当然。\n我希望育你们的新歌录制工作能圆满成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0033_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "a9de691874c2760faea76f9ab4621a2fa2db34b44fecabd8d194d48bfda9cfdb", "ja": "えっ！？　そうだったんだ……。\nありがとう、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "咦！？是这样啊……\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0033_1006_p", "source_sha256": "06c4aa82e970df8f5d7a0e02223af619d0b8774746251f552037a27401eb3230", "ja": "いや、新曲の仕事がうまくいったのは、\n育たちが頑張ったからだ。気にしなくていいぞ。", "zh": "不，新歌录制工作之所以能顺利完成，\n都是因为育你们很努力，别放在心上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0033_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d704489194ca1c7179321090ad977c54fcac5368c9e93792da89ee92f88191f9", "ja": "それで、育は何かお願いをしたのか？", "zh": "倒是育有许什么愿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0033_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "f68ebb073e35d72e820d31f22d87c5d4196a245418f0fac84bae4fa507a6010a", "ja": "うん！　みんながいつまでも、\n仲良しでいられますようにって。", "zh": "嗯！\n我希望大家的感情能永远都这么好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0033_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d54ba8456b9eed5774e370aa99ae2f0dabfb6978ed42f6d34ebfd971074e91c2", "ja": "そうか。なら、きっと大丈夫だな。\nアイドル達みんな、同じことを思ってるだろうから。", "zh": "是吗？那一定没问题的。\n因为偶像们应该都有着同样的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0033_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "1babff99d52a655d0465e2317bf2f7204c9d5e30646707c45ea29f4b07430588", "ja": "それじゃ、ひとり足りないじゃない。\nちゃんと、{$P$}さんも入れてね！", "zh": "你这样说，不就少了一个人吗？\n也得把{$P$}先生算进来呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0033_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8544e4e12dbeea99038d514abb47e46e817337fce28536ec6307d51d51b2f867", "ja": "おっと、ごめんごめん。そうだな、俺も含めて\nみんなと。これからも、仲良く頑張ろうな！", "zh": "哎呀，抱歉抱歉。你说得对，包含我在内，\n今后也大家一起和乐融融地加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0033_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "276c4578221f21563bd5e0c3de5b69466e9c82718042621204f304749ea15628", "ja": "うん！　えへへ、流れ星の約束ね！", "zh": "嗯！嘿嘿，这是跟流星的约定呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
